  "disclosures": {
    "btcPriorUse": "None. No BTC strategy evaluation has opened data on or after 2026-08-25 (checked 2026-10-01).",
    "ethPriorUse": "ETH 2026-08-25~2026-09-01 was already used by the rejected ETH V2 research (strict OOS receipt eth-perp-v2.6-20260903, hard_oos_end 2026-09-01). The public ETH preset's ladder was selected on 2026-09-07 and its wallet usage (U82) was fixed on 2026-09-08, both using data through 2026-08-24; market data from 2026-09-02 onward already existed at selection time but was not used. One exception: earlier historical ETH evaluations valued a position open at the end with the 2026-08-25 00:00 UTC mark-price minute and, on the indirect evidence of a reviewer we commissioned, also charged the funding payment settled at that minute in the funding scenarios (both corrected and disclosed on 2026-09-30); the runs used to choose the preset may also have read that minute. Both the full window 2026-08-25~2026-09-30 (not used in preset selection, apart from that minute) and the partial window 2026-09-02~2026-09-30 (not used in any prior research) are reported.",
    "engineDifferences": "Each engine is internally consistent but the two differ: BTC legacy engine charges entry fees at TP and an exit fee of 0.05% of entry notional; the ETH engine charges entry fees on fill (plus 1bp entry slippage in every variant) and values the exit with a 0.02% limit fee on exit notional rounded down to the price tick. BTC max_step/MAE/utilization summary fields count closed cycles only; see terminal for the open position.",
    "hashPublicationDatesNote": "hashPublicationDates are calendar dates in Korea Standard Time (UTC+9). The BTC report hash went live on 2026-08-25 18:24 UTC (2026-08-26 KST); the ETH report hash on 2026-09-08 10:36 UTC."
